```elixir
p1
|> Plot.theme_void()
|> render.()
```

## The default theme with panels

```r
# Theme examples with panels
p2 <- p1 + facet_grid(vs ~ am)

p2 + theme_gray() # the default
```

Not in Giggly yet: `facet_grid()`.

